WEBVTT

00:00:00.862 --> 00:00:03.740
-Harry! What is it?
-Get back to the cup!

00:00:11.331 --> 00:00:13.750
-Who are you? What do you want?
VOLDEMORT: Kill the spare.

00:00:13.958 --> 00:00:16.628
-Avada Kedavra!
-No! Cedric!

00:00:21.257 --> 00:00:23.760
[GRUNTING]

00:00:28.014 --> 00:00:29.891
Do it! Now!

00:00:35.021 --> 00:00:36.522
[GRUNTS]

00:00:41.778 --> 00:00:44.155
Bone of the father...

00:00:44.405 --> 00:00:46.783
...unwillingly given.

00:00:54.123 --> 00:00:57.168
Flesh of the servant...

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:02.423
...willingly sacrificed.

00:01:03.091 --> 00:01:05.301
[WORMTAIL YELLS]

00:01:06.552 --> 00:01:10.181
And blood of the enemy...

00:01:14.102 --> 00:01:16.020
[GRUNTING]

00:01:16.104 --> 00:01:20.024
-...forcibly taken.
-Oh! Aah! Aah!

00:01:20.108 --> 00:01:21.818
[GRUNTING]

00:01:24.654 --> 00:01:27.573
The Dark Lord shall rise...

00:01:28.324 --> 00:01:30.201
-...again.
-Aah!

00:01:31.119 --> 00:01:33.121
[HARRY YELLING]

00:01:42.714 --> 00:01:44.841
[WIND HOWLING]

00:01:53.599 --> 00:01:57.812
[HARRY GRUNTING]

00:02:04.068 --> 00:02:06.154
[BREATHING DEEPLY]

00:02:27.258 --> 00:02:28.843
[CHUCKLES]

00:02:33.723 --> 00:02:37.185
My wand, Wormtail.

00:02:46.652 --> 00:02:48.613
Hold out your arm.

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.281
Master.

00:02:50.531 --> 00:02:53.201
Thank you, master.

00:02:53.284 --> 00:02:54.869
The other arm, Wormtail.

00:03:08.674 --> 00:03:10.802
[THUNDER RUMBLING]

00:03:13.638 --> 00:03:15.681
[HOWLING AND MOANING]

00:03:35.326 --> 00:03:37.286
Welcome, my friends.

00:03:38.788 --> 00:03:41.457
Thirteen years it's been, and yet...

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:47.672
...here you stand before me
as though it were only yesterday.

00:03:48.589 --> 00:03:51.467
I confess myself...

00:03:52.093 --> 00:03:53.553
...disappointed.

00:03:54.262 --> 00:03:56.264
Not one of you tried to find me.

00:03:56.472 --> 00:03:59.934
Crabbe! Macnair!

00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:02.228
Goyle!

00:04:04.605 --> 00:04:06.274
Not even you...

00:04:10.236 --> 00:04:12.113
...Lucius.

00:04:13.948 --> 00:04:18.744
My Lord, had I detected any sign,
a whisper of your whereabouts--

00:04:18.953 --> 00:04:21.956
There were signs, my slippery friend.
And more than whispers.

00:04:22.123 --> 00:04:27.295
I assure you, my Lord,
I have never renounced the old ways.

00:04:29.005 --> 00:04:34.510
The face I have been obliged to present
each day since your absence...

00:04:36.512 --> 00:04:39.307
...that is my true mask.

00:04:39.515 --> 00:04:41.267
I returned.

00:04:41.976 --> 00:04:43.352
[GASPS]

00:04:43.603 --> 00:04:47.398
Out of fear, not loyalty.

00:04:48.649 --> 00:04:54.363
Still, you have proved yourself useful
these past few months, Wormtail.

00:04:59.619 --> 00:05:02.038
Thank you, master.

00:05:02.538 --> 00:05:04.332
Thank you.

00:05:05.166 --> 00:05:07.251
VOLDEMORT:
Oh. Tsk, tsk, tsk.

00:05:07.335 --> 00:05:09.795
-Such a handsome boy.
HARRY: Don't touch him!

00:05:11.339 --> 00:05:12.757
VOLDEMORT:
Harry.

00:05:12.924 --> 00:05:15.676
I'd almost forgotten you were here.

00:05:15.885 --> 00:05:20.306
Standing on the bones
of my father. Yeah.

00:05:20.389 --> 00:05:21.807
I'd introduce you...

00:05:22.058 --> 00:05:26.354
...but word has it you're almost
as famous as me these days.

00:05:29.023 --> 00:05:31.567
The boy who lived.

00:05:31.817 --> 00:05:34.695
How lies have fed your legend, Harry.

00:05:34.904 --> 00:05:38.908
Shall I reveal what really happened
that night 13 years ago?

00:05:39.075 --> 00:05:43.788
Shall I divulge how
I truly lost my powers?

00:05:43.955 --> 00:05:45.373
Yes, shall I?

00:05:45.915 --> 00:05:47.291
It was love.

00:05:47.375 --> 00:05:51.921
You see, when dear, sweet Lily Potter
gave her life for her only son...

00:05:52.088 --> 00:05:54.590
...she provided the ultimate protection.

00:05:55.091 --> 00:05:56.842
I could not touch him.

00:05:58.094 --> 00:06:00.304
It was old magic.

00:06:00.388 --> 00:06:02.598
Something I should have foreseen.

00:06:02.848 --> 00:06:04.600
But no matter, no matter.

00:06:04.809 --> 00:06:07.061
Things have changed.

00:06:07.728 --> 00:06:11.357
I can touch you...

00:06:11.857 --> 00:06:13.484
...now.

00:06:14.318 --> 00:06:16.404
[SCREAMING]

00:06:18.364 --> 00:06:20.324
[MOANING]

00:06:21.742 --> 00:06:23.119
Yeah.

00:06:24.829 --> 00:06:26.372
[YELLS]

00:06:29.417 --> 00:06:33.129
Astonishing what a few drops
of your blood will do, eh, Harry?

00:06:34.422 --> 00:06:36.007
Pick up your wand, Potter.

00:06:37.508 --> 00:06:39.844
I said, pick it up! Get up! Get up!

00:06:41.429 --> 00:06:43.723
You've been taught how to duel,
I presume, yes?

00:06:43.889 --> 00:06:46.350
First, we bow to each other.

00:06:46.434 --> 00:06:48.894
Come on, now, Harry.
The niceties must be observed.

00:06:49.145 --> 00:06:52.356
Dumbledore wouldn't want you
to forget your manners, would he?

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:53.774
I said, bow.

00:06:53.983 --> 00:06:55.443
[GRUNTS]

00:06:55.526 --> 00:06:59.989
-That's better. And now....
-No.

00:07:00.448 --> 00:07:02.366
Crucio!

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:06.454
Crucio!

00:07:07.455 --> 00:07:09.457
Attaboy, Harry.

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:11.751
Your parents would be proud.

00:07:12.126 --> 00:07:15.463
Especially your filthy Muggle mother.

00:07:15.546 --> 00:07:17.298
Expelliar--

00:07:20.301 --> 00:07:22.553
I'm going to kill you, Harry Potter.

00:07:22.803 --> 00:07:24.805
I'm going to destroy you.

00:07:27.016 --> 00:07:32.521
After tonight, no one will ever again
question my powers.

00:07:33.314 --> 00:07:35.775
After tonight, if they speak of you...

00:07:35.941 --> 00:07:38.569
...they'll speak only of how you...

00:07:38.944 --> 00:07:40.696
...begged for death.

00:07:40.946 --> 00:07:44.575
And I, being a merciful Lord...

00:07:45.326 --> 00:07:46.827
...obliged.

00:07:47.203 --> 00:07:48.579
Get up!

00:07:48.913 --> 00:07:50.956
[GRUNTING]

00:07:53.584 --> 00:07:55.586
Don't you turn your back on me,
Harry Potter!

00:07:55.795 --> 00:07:58.089
I want you to look at me
when I kill you!

00:07:58.339 --> 00:08:01.509
I want to see the light
leave your eyes!

00:08:05.513 --> 00:08:06.972
[GRUNTS]

00:08:07.181 --> 00:08:09.225
[PANTING]

00:08:15.481 --> 00:08:17.191
Have it your way.

00:08:18.234 --> 00:08:20.528
-Expelliarmus!
-Avada Kedavra!

00:08:38.087 --> 00:08:40.631
Do nothing! He's mine to finish!

00:08:40.965 --> 00:08:42.550
[GRUNTING]

00:08:45.386 --> 00:08:47.012
He's mine!

00:08:47.555 --> 00:08:48.889
[GRUNTS]

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:56.564
[GROANS]

00:09:20.129 --> 00:09:24.133
Harry, when the connection is broken,
you must get to the Portkey.

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:26.427
We can linger for a moment
to give you some time...

00:09:26.594 --> 00:09:28.304
...but only a moment.
Do you understand?

00:09:29.555 --> 00:09:32.516
CEDRIC:
Harry, take my body back, will you?

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:35.269
Take my body back to my father.

00:09:36.312 --> 00:09:37.605
Let go.

00:09:38.063 --> 00:09:40.024
Sweetheart, you're ready.

00:09:40.816 --> 00:09:43.569
Let go! Let go!

00:09:49.283 --> 00:09:50.618
Accio!

00:09:56.332 --> 00:09:58.334
No!

00:09:58.626 --> 00:10:00.211
[CROWD CHEERING]

00:10:02.713 --> 00:10:04.673
[MARCHING BAND PLAYING]
[SOBBING]

00:10:11.055 --> 00:10:11.060
AMOS:
He did it!
